  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "馬眼長股，宜行善市。皆蒙福佑，獲金三倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:44975929137549d40486ffacf5c4502ae516d9e37e7ad5e07c1736eea0cb9a3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:84da175dfcbc49c5732038924897a8c5c84f788cad85fd528d4405cda23b0ca6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "高原峻山，阯大少泉。草木林麓，喜得所蓄。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eafc5833840c12e97adec4fd16f3d27fa488efd2b48f6543687c3d99fc80810d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:58f2891ffc7c286d3b032999ba68ef10f1a6d825510cc23b0d9f4dbc6cf6277e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "一門二關，結弭不便。峻道異路，日暮不到。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:afc351f1105344673b87c6d030a19b4d4f01c459a1e1af8692c5831021551b22",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9d8545cc04f5f8c72a7096f89df41c130b9da50910d97eaa8d696d7e0301d9c9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "憂患解除，喜至慶來。坐立懽門，與樂為鄰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:44297e7f58c7a88c4f0249598366a5871dafb5dd87fb980fc1af0815a1eb89da",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5e0044440eccba03be559581022f1e5e92f2e33282ded685e5ae85deea759440"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "疏類異路，心不相慕。牝牛牡豭，鰥無室家。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:685f3b235f5ddc7491cdb6729adf1d71c53af28e1b4d511ee98f078a2c0d1200",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eeb88eea1b3c003754aab54e4fda3a7aa2f3a4f0610077de379dd354d36988fd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "太王為父，王季孝友。文武聖明，仁政興起。旦隆四國，載福綏厚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0d2cc20c6e2067d49880ffadd17cb3516c3dc60b06744aa4d5b40e143fbbee3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:27f02d39b0807674414c7b0dce10ae406400768b6dd59f33ba06a8797834a126"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "臨河求鯉，燕婉笑弭。屏氣攝息，不得鯉子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f090c571c9ceedc77450f20df4806932e1643fd2016bee14791bcd64b4d17180",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bfaef9f4d0f9327f51ca6eeceb58cfcbbc8b8e86b6337e8ae57ca852a8af0091"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "買利求福，莫如南國。仁德所在，金玉為寶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fe70077174db07b1cdbf26bebe10f4f5b2e737b8f7dfa62f9f40cdb8b6fc67a0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d31b4cf860d618bf5172cff0acd34a11f54388fa569ae4c2f6541c90e061477d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "白虎赤憤，門觀王庭。宮闕被甲，大小出征。天下煩憒，育不能嬰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1b57f53826126e79cb7e0d490d047415b10c18e5886c3f6eaedca93f46be63ad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a1ca8d6ea20e984f8449bf14aedfb2ea67513dded578e2d54f236c2d72ef84ef"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "子車鍼虎，善人危殆。黃鳥悲鳴，傷國無輔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3d48d0ccde3e215f179e73bdd4e39d1e36daf707b7d17645aeb636d38557d970",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:149206a7c3b4ed2c29ea94cea32aed16865fa37aa4d12a87032cb93244d6ffb9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "兩目失明，入暮無光。脛足跛步，不可以行。頓於丘傍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cc195e43e7e77b36eec85692095b4c87f3d4f8f1756adba32e8e35d96c86f77a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1695061702a9511580ba9d3de2ce577490b0980f6f3be0f817a096e7a2d36fb3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "羅網四張，鳥無所翔。征伐困極，飢窮不食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1cfd87b0c00ff2b09c1e295b79cf3fdaa8b0b70183340effbf5f998f63bbb123",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d0de6011c561d26a09cd1e2747abfeb29c14163bf3373efa6fd3cfa7e17b43c3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "伯夷叔齊，貞廉之師。以德防患，憂禍不存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:52f2880f1fcf6e0ecb9ecd752346073b2a94da357f1f765f7f61b58c42beb2c9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:78260c95cc8c3ad07b201a3259bd620299db12966d2d2aa4d9aab51fc9ea6943"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "疾貧望幸，使伯行販。開牢擇羊，多得大牂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:783e4267a1e90a55698673cd3e7a9a5fa3278bbe72d81b9bc0d273c93f29881a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fd9e499d08631db76cc877ef9d85492ca458425103fa64576494740a6413ecc2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "南山之楊，其葉將將。嘉樂君子，為國寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:374d9b369ca3962abe3fd3d0c51df4777d3edd1e5f9691628ef433bb36934fda",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bbeaef90ff451be295d29dc9aa37a5a0b1b1954250d3197468357eb0dad9614a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "東壁餘光，數暗不明。主母嫉妒，亂我事業。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:24939a8e0c8a0efba38d177499e12671b978341a85990b3d69b5ab2ccabb4a28",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d5c879c121134cad8dc515ed001bbae86235ce5cca5d9807e80f6e77eeda3c0e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "迷行晨夜，道多湛露。沾濡襦褲，重不可步。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8034459d4170d65f91b2e6ef1d2bebfd3fbb6224d67e2edb9a1daf30eae7e4ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:70544128b706339011cc129a13a379219cf40a0bc8348cd2e1ac51a93ad6b706"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "目瞤足動，嘉喜有頃，舉家蒙寵。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dcdc1401d1f91efcb8ad41696fdc423c3039c1cea54d506c4320d7f6d28022ff",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bcbb5bfab0c79d94aa8d7c0b3726acdd8f92ca298d276fd5e906af39c0e7f842"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "鷹鷂欲食，雉兔困急。延頸見尾，為我所賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:611f8bd79e6a96271c2afb6e43b2ee7c3c59a7dd20268ec1419ce999b19c73b1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a000738115b8342a13183a47cf72037930e0fe057627f9b63db07434f646acd3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "鼻移在項，枯葉傷生。下枯上榮，家擾不寧。失其金城。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a76430e759436bd6229f2bacf1048edaed4b8e08fa5964563cd9e4170e854e1f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cef137a030888820762ed2082a2441604db65f61420d37fd76a73456f13a2678"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "飛不遠去，汝為內傷。祿養未富，終無災咎。君善安止。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a1fbbfb6cf78ecd83889285cf60465472c6848522fbd14731c6ddbe42acdbce0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:19334207ce897b72a175e5777e3e019340f67ea0cffe327ae6ece6faf2030aa5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "倒基敗筥，重舌作凶。被髮長夜，迷亂相誤。深亡吉居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:05ded93d4913209417623fd4dfbaeb7a3ec5b0bad45f020b5978025c2dac1c71",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9681200cf4b1de155064f805e8c7bd00036b7ac7d57e6f148a145199416393b4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "亥午相錯，敗亂緒業。民不得作。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:561153185559eff50338ca5d35bd594ef06d2d1b84e48a79cfe1b713d35901a5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cf7b5d3fbdae7b609d9341d3a6359adbb7069afbb39a1f26ae6ab798cd5e5a69"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "野麋畏人，俱入山谷。命短不長，為虎所得。死於牙腹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1b7b87aeddbf2cd4b44c131d45d2ae5018c2091ab1fa7df964331bac42edfd74",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:91af0c88ce34e95f0178d59e6f11e7acccd9632ac7727ada434a1b7ba6f33a6b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "秋冬探巢，不得鵲雛。御指北去，愧我少姬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e004ceb78fe5e26daf02706a533d72ec6212be93ac064731cc13d0b5aa69db16",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d975fa9e92c9a3969c332901bc691108c22ced57f53f23f460920bf710212779"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "雙鳧俱飛，欲歸稻池。經涉雚澤，為矢所射。傷我胸臆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d5b4eb60aaa1b3c6378130207e5d041f3395e3cbb49d25058c1d49958ae02ffa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fce2751a887e845f45bc4fb91de5d1ab51700a192652bb59c207f1a6c12823ea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "天門開闢，宇戶寥廓。桎梏解脫，拘囚縱釋。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:129b70f35c0b4e90ab2df0cd038a1431bcb0ea3a2a3a08364ec31136ce5688d2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:25b84b159bb9057319446e1f2dcce480bfb8879b25ca5ba84d101bd7353db844"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "尼父孔丘，善釣鯉魚。羅網一舉，得獲萬頭。富我家居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:88f264bdb0c6be42b284cecf6a3c563ddbd40fac0040bc5cfbf842f6d759b95f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d4bed71b4deb545547c47b7d04b88899713942c613646fbfae017f3e237b6b7a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "彭生為妖，暴龍作災。盜堯衣裳，聚跖荷兵。青禽照夜，三旦夷亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a108470d590d8d99908eb896885d8f346a52875811de4b91289b2c7b44176d5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2b365475a66f4d6d31f53b5edc07a397e76178524c7a6248be966ca2b0c930b3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "華言風語，亂相誑誤。終無凶事，安寧如故。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5988360abceb846e1a313f419141a6fba10bfda86a5c2ecbcd5930080353cef8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1f23b8ca9e4cb4af9f6299683a8aa339d4a53b5b2239128f17276c37b022da7c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "延頸見足，身困名辱。欲隱避仇，為害所滅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d6a2cee983bb5c434cef3a467935c14475face895b1948f389e44a09fe0382aa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:abca50e25b1ad5cda3587806422d4a77f66ab844bef01e918f20d50a2ec862be"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "無足斷跟，居處不安。凶惡為殘，君臣相得。一作君臣得安，和合於天。保下奠上，大相蒙湛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ac55831456b2eb18323bf7f987f0afd924eac7c3bc9889d7e1d64e9653ceaadc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a46a4d539e6f69a8609e2b55e8ce6b0153dbb209d2b8f80cc74e51004ac6e2c3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "三人俱行，北求大牂。孟長病足，借季負糧。柳下之貞，不失驪黃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:813990caaee21618210a5c10657a4108ef5127f68c8db10ef5f6b5e3520b6b0f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b1d91578bee6d786cba6a702149081552da6a062ae432c6ff1b155582c03a906"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "退飛見祥，傷敗毀墜。守小失大，功名不遂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:275340bd9388896bb5be6e9fa6c209d83227d70c3c61927e5eddda157fee1935",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8b3e5ba0c07253e781f7072638c7c2eb3c7a3dd7f90dcbbb3cca08f88bbf6036"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "持心懼怒，善搖數動。不安其處，散渙府藏。利得無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5d4b857bddfdda471679fae6c0f6e69f46600f0750f3e66e6cb260d49b63a2b8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c4294d77788eb806b47c4ce95b70acffeee5adab389b66624689a290f022befa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "牽尾不前，逆理失臣，怒翔以奔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7ed45dbd7d824623a82736d63d9d570c4d8bfa94791073f63076210cb7dfe5ef",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3a5f142ca3610bdf3d0c19502bdad01aac52bf5309f240e779e0803e2e17d8c2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "祿如周公，建國洛東，父子俱封。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:09db28f1a5c1b8d51c42c8fe4749fe9ed9c9ef72e3f4c2e8f9940d224afcaf20",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:899857679fc882a965b7e06d9c629cdef4bf7264caa5632417cf0697eff51fb7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "君有八人，信允篤敏，為堯所舉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bcd87178a2a13ce304fee59862d4e923d2cf366546bc9e638697861855a7b78c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1c991174f76258dd04897b45a9e46d632d170a6ecb315e0e4027f703455b8bc2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "久陰霖雨，泥塗行潦。商人休止，市空無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:80e095af1e8f9e07df9ddd6bbcab4e6c76496bb1d983ac334c47bc97bdbc4940",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8a405b1b76db6b0ca1d42697e70d086020ae40d008ecdf6dc11e6b2e167dcd9f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "無足斷跟，居處不安。凶惡為殘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f7c5a0f51c7043d417d96442f143299ca5896e72566b7ee8a1e50f35a7cfa85b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:41afcf23d2a61e98a8bd3ae8372bbe9ed2e1cb327257242598c07b80a220e8bd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "馬蹄躓車，婦惡破家。青蠅污白，恭子離居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:38b691c03d42983a6facdc59112d1289cb8735f3b87b88f7e0f796eae9e6387b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3a974e7ae8c363e80206c719afecf4c2787814c013c23797583831b6ee5d2cb3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "噂噂所言，莫如我垣。歡喜堅固，可以長安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e36382d11f03ce403af79ea9c4ce879aa78b5011fcd4d75761526b7cb5104729",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d1eb64c0440db866ba801e3841e12209e449d0529dd73fd1201294020bb2eaf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "懿公淺愚，不受深謀。無援失國，為狄所滅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1222a2d92e87290c876ef70bfc17c592aa10364a5c1e47fd7ab5928cdfffde8d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d0cb68001c7320bbd65bc617837573f14711d517970d185ba125cc61793d6f8e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "騏驥綠耳，章明造父。風伯所獻，襄續厥緒。佐文成伯，為晉元輔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:43026483e427572461e1c6e217ea0c69a668032fa644edbadef921dc2296729c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:beeabd8123dc4f0a9057cdcf2ee6bf381de7ea9bc70984d71983801a01d8ba1c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "駕車十里，來鮮魴鯉。非其肆居，自今後市。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:616b062bfc2ce24db08cd0bd627e10cb080623f57ab9390bc0ee754a27e9e781",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bd732d0adcfbfa65b3ebdbe0a05b96591183240d14ce7288abc80ce0898a0c98"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "求麞嘉鄉，惡地不行。道止中返，復還其床。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2d4ac65f88aa9d72708904ebe9b4b61cade3a78dab333212b8592f4ddd503c97",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2a4e16c7da0c45e14463d592dddd20c3bc9e6ed997015014f3fa0ed8da6e8d08"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "使鳩負裝，醉臥道傍。不知何功，竊我衣囊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:01144a094704cf3464475f6f1bbc15ab8709fe77e33341268c4373dd1e289fa5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d0adc068353054e4214d918e2c5f5442fee1fb6864eb7c359e8d49f1cab3d453"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "登崑崙，入天門。過糟丘，宿玉泉。問惠觀，見仁君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:43d66af0a0d1815168ebce3e6bda4fc7affc82da24fcf4c563edabe7b1e93787",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bd7ea69fc49878f8153b5d998fd38ce906af2ec0592eb45f01644a6fb60b27a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "木為大床，患厭不起。季伯夜行，與善相逢。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cbe66e2a65535ee7f4e415193efbeac8fd02888faf45203b89b1f28e6b650826",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d0137923843e0cd2e3ba36c96664e0bd864c19d78b1f2c3fba68d1c8c0c8c682"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "烏孫氏女，深目黑醜。嗜欲不同，過時無耦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d9f73d197f7fc828f9a3f9af82c53f8fa9ca0fa509de4bbe463c89fb482cc381",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6d0f3632ff530ff54e96f7a20a5e7d4976bddbb9a902f25ef9697ccabc383b3c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "子鉏執麟，春秋作經。元聖將終，尼父悲心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:68d1fc2a0e07d3cebfb073b15307cc93b368bc7ca14c949b3cb94e083858a7d5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf65933fbe73ea50a7302a68428c6611a9120fae42f611a36d5a787aed75bffa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "灼火泉源，釣魴山巔。魚不可得，火不肯燃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9a2ab768131dda50c8712e351f48841fb651c627663b5f483088551650255ae1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:59b1ec8077c241dbcf29d488245929b4847dd10f53fc68a10dca319cefcd92ef"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "天馬五道，炎火久處。往來上下，作文約己。衣枲絲麻，相隨笑歌，凶惡如何。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5f6445d9ea3e98ec274e574cf3dfd7b63ad43c9eb3804935071834651d6e3b38",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:87b01fff1fbf45d94f727ffbf5ea9df48eac007780310b979cadb9f252c88494"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "鴟鴞破斧，沖人危殆。賴旦忠德，轉禍為福。危傾復立。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:caa4586c7052e36d47981f583e9f58edd28b68b30304f16786538c25b06c0a25",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a12b41a883355ec7527c7be3b9b7545734a1260eeccfc4b5ff66a359fe73f523"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "牡飛關啟，憂患大解，不為身禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a31eb76744961f9ce8afd6295c8b8ed766ec7c3b26f9ef87c34a85745822eea8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8252ea68fb7d71b40ff71081c049e8507256b9993731c12c3eafaef80322d766"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "石門晨門，荷蕢食貧。遁世隱居，竟不逢時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aa4ed899ec1dcbd469b204cde4abea72ee8f529a3b741bc5b6553607f8017140",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:564aacd9b9db38ad1e116d130ed289ae73b8ec5fab2cb1d48c8c21452cfe05cc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "兔聚東郭，眾犬俱獵。圍缺不成，無所能獲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:56b19385a4aa142b1239cbdaa7b6fed4417ef124b57710d8955f8c6a9f47ac0f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:86613a9fa7d69b893792c6172dfe3d078f9d114c31c96bee0bbff7a89222eed0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "三羊群走，雉兔驚駭。非所畏懼，自令勞苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5e27c5d56e2ec6847bb6d700c2ff67c47170b67c0f36a9d5e9efcfc5324fc99c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2614e7c27ada8b09d3b357a48af6b4eb769842cd15426003acc2748b66165548"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "羽翮病傷，無以為強。宋公德薄，敗於水泓。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d61b2d876b1ed57017a880e7c71e23de530bb1994d62b3eab64cba9a9c210094",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:869ad5b7f22ed869f1266139564e717f3ef8b88f50f43de55a3f2d031e7b19e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "姬姜稚叔，三人偶食。論仁議福，以安王室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fbb578d10663246134742da16d11b100bc43fb0961e99cb8462b7973f1ca6531",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:25788c356732f04bee0081e421065101f19811d775a549454866dbbdf1a1b661"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "精誠所在，神人為輔。德教亡患，彌世長久。三聖仍事，多受福祉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:af6c4f9242a2850cf99aa0ecaec2309d5bd3c8e17733863cabeb322f2b0acdba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c02b0f974a8ed82aa5c8d655bece633836e6f6d06c175262d607f0de51a816ea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "岐周海隅，獨樂不憂。可以避難，全身保財。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bfeb6f072ac6dc9ada20f4d2de9bae51abbd3aee67888d7f4d07945d5748ff3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8f462e3476b6289462e7bac0e49c0c6522762736e65ee29e4f6e753037e43b12"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "孤獨特處，莫為依輔，心勞志苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fd095176018e074dc1038d57889c78740af07057263f324719eef7ff95b9bf18",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f752500709efe8c059992af32ff7ad5a6a690f1447dc588784c88c52fc22d055"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 49,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "顧望登臺，意常欲逃。買辛醜惡，妻不安夫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec11db244efd31930866348cd8770e6a043654cf9cbefb2032dc66e01a95c989",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:108f1a0426828775814ddd465bc58070a49da50daf168ca80c79ceb83f903dc7"
    }
  ]
}
